WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:18.692
Yikes! Who are you?

2
00:00:18.693 --> 00:00:23.459
I'm a black widow spider.

3
00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:28.198
Spiders have eight legs.

4
00:00:28.199 --> 00:00:31.013
Where do you live?

5
00:00:31.014 --> 00:00:36.861
Black widow spiders live all over the world.

6
00:00:36.862 --> 00:00:41.004
We like dark places.

7
00:00:41.005 --> 00:00:49.870
We often hide under rocks or in basements.

8
00:00:49.871 --> 00:00:53.685
I like your red markings.

9
00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:58.092
Only females have these markings.

10
00:00:58.093 --> 00:01:03.320
Our markings look like an hourglass.

11
00:01:03.321 --> 00:01:06.167
What do you eat?

12
00:01:06.168 --> 00:01:09.699
We eat bugs.

13
00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:15.563
We like flies, beetles, and grasshoppers.

14
00:01:15.564 --> 00:01:18.619
How do you catch prey?

15
00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:23.445
We make webs.

16
00:01:23.446 --> 00:01:28.489
Then we wait for bugs to come by.

17
00:01:28.490 --> 00:01:33.542
The bugs get caught in our webs.

18
00:01:33.543 --> 00:01:36.219
How do you make a web?

19
00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:39.482
We use silk.

20
00:01:39.483 --> 00:01:43.826
Our bodies make the silk.

21
00:01:43.827 --> 00:01:49.002
The silk is very strong and sticky.

22
00:01:49.003 --> 00:01:52.165
You're dangerous, right?

23
00:01:52.166 --> 00:01:56.631
We usually leave people alone.

24
00:01:56.632 --> 00:02:01.370
But we do bite.

25
00:02:01.371 --> 00:02:08.174
Our bites can make people very sick.

26
00:02:08.175 --> 00:02:13.596
Oh! I trapped a grasshopper in my web!

27
00:02:13.597 --> 00:02:15.905
Good-bye.

28
00:02:15.906 --> 00:02:24.934
Good-bye, Black Widow Spider!
